WEBVTT

00:05.060 --> 00:08.070
So since Mr. Tani's
scouting the area,

00:08.070 --> 00:10.440
we can focus on the enemy in front.

00:10.990 --> 00:12.490
We might be able to rack up some kills.

00:12.740 --> 00:14.450
<i>My head hurts.</i>

00:15.450 --> 00:16.950
The next map in particular...

00:18.160 --> 00:21.830
<i>Wait, I can hear someone talking.</i>

00:22.330 --> 00:24.920
I told you, I'm not turning on my camera.

00:26.380 --> 00:27.540
<i>Who is that?</i>

00:28.590 --> 00:30.090
You're getting annoying.

00:39.760 --> 00:42.470
Hey, sorry.

00:42.470 --> 00:43.560
I'm gonna AFK for a sec.

00:46.100 --> 00:47.230
Be right back.

00:49.610 --> 00:50.980
<i>What is...</i>

00:56.200 --> 00:57.490
<i>going on here?</i>

01:00.200 --> 01:01.040
Um...

01:01.370 --> 01:02.200
Yes?

01:09.840 --> 01:11.340
Um...

01:14.170 --> 01:15.130
I...

01:17.340 --> 01:18.970
Don't tell me I...

01:23.140 --> 01:24.930
Don't tell me it was a one-night stand?

01:24.930 --> 01:25.970
Is that what it looks like?

01:25.970 --> 01:26.980
No, not really!

02:58.610 --> 03:00.030
Well, long story short...

03:02.070 --> 03:03.530
it was either take care of you...

03:05.120 --> 03:07.830
or abandon you on the street.

03:10.250 --> 03:13.210
But even I thought
that might be too inhumane.

03:14.420 --> 03:16.090
I am truly, deeply sorry.

03:16.880 --> 03:18.380
I'll thank you properly, no matter—

03:18.380 --> 03:20.300
Just leave right now,
and we'll call it even.

03:20.300 --> 03:21.930
Right! I'm leaving right now!

03:24.350 --> 03:26.680
By the way,
about your puke-covered clothes...

03:27.180 --> 03:29.230
I washed them
and hung them up in the bathroom.

03:29.810 --> 03:32.060
And I also paid your bill
from the izakaya.

03:32.060 --> 03:34.440
I'll pay you back
right this minute!

03:34.940 --> 03:36.110
<i>This is bad.</i>

03:36.110 --> 03:38.820
Excuse me. Where's the bathroom?

03:38.820 --> 03:40.110
Out the door and to the right.

03:40.650 --> 03:42.700
There's just no excuse for this.

03:43.700 --> 03:46.700
Well, I don't think
I'll be seeing you anymore...

03:48.330 --> 03:49.200
but take care.

03:58.050 --> 03:59.590
<i>Now I've gone and done it.</i>

04:00.630 --> 04:04.430
<i>Not to mention, I spent the night
at the apartment of a man I just met.</i>

04:06.140 --> 04:08.430
<i>Forgive me, Mom back in Gunma.</i>

04:14.900 --> 04:16.360
I'm so wiped.

04:18.190 --> 04:20.780
<i>I've got to work on my paper.</i>

04:23.900 --> 04:24.740
Hmm?

04:27.780 --> 04:28.780
<i>Wait.</i>

04:34.080 --> 04:37.670
<i>I was wearing a necklace, right?</i>

04:38.880 --> 04:41.340
<i>Huh? Where'd it go?</i>

04:54.730 --> 04:55.640
Not here.

05:01.320 --> 05:03.240
<i>About your puke-covered clothes...</i>

05:03.240 --> 05:05.360
<i>I washed them
and hung them up in the bathroom.</i>

05:07.360 --> 05:08.280
<i>Don't tell me...</i>

05:10.780 --> 05:12.950
<i>I dropped it in Yamada's apartment?</i>

05:19.500 --> 05:20.340
Hey!

05:20.710 --> 05:22.340
Akane! Hello!

05:24.470 --> 05:26.550
Rurihime! Hello!

05:26.550 --> 05:28.010
<i>Yamada! Where's Yamada?</i>

05:30.260 --> 05:31.810
<i>Offline!</i>

05:32.310 --> 05:34.980
<i>I know I still had it on
at the izakaya.</i>

05:35.640 --> 05:37.690
<i>If I dropped it,
it must have been afterwards.</i>

05:38.190 --> 05:41.980
<i>So it had to have been when I
took off my clothes at Yamada's place.</i>

05:43.650 --> 05:45.240
<i>What am I gonna do?</i>

05:47.320 --> 05:51.740
<i>That necklace was the first present
I ever got from Takuma.</i>

05:53.910 --> 05:56.500
What's this? Are you frozen, Akane?

05:57.040 --> 05:59.120
Are you not feeling well, maybe?

06:10.550 --> 06:12.430
Ruri will be happy to hear your story!

06:12.430 --> 06:16.310
Since Ruri is everyone's master,
she wants you to depend on her!

06:16.310 --> 06:20.650
<i>Oh, Rurihime, you're always such a cutie!</i>

06:22.060 --> 06:23.650
Oh, I see.

06:24.150 --> 06:25.690
You got dumped by your boyfriend,

06:25.690 --> 06:28.360
and now you've lost
your precious necklace.

06:28.740 --> 06:30.240
Ruri gets it.

06:30.240 --> 06:33.490
After all, Ruri gets
tons of presents from her fans,

06:33.490 --> 06:34.990
and they're all so precious to her!

06:35.540 --> 06:38.120
And each one is memorable in its own way!

06:38.330 --> 06:41.630
But lately, I've been running out of space
to store them all, you know?

06:41.960 --> 06:42.880
Wow.

06:43.920 --> 06:44.750
- Huh?
- Oh!

06:47.340 --> 06:48.880
Yamada! Hello!

06:50.050 --> 06:50.890
Hello.

06:51.050 --> 06:52.510
<i>Yamada's here!</i>

06:52.510 --> 06:53.470
<i>Um...</i>

06:53.760 --> 06:55.470
- Yamada!
- Yama! Ya! Yamada!

06:55.470 --> 06:58.230
Yamada, come over here,
and let's talk about romance!

06:58.640 --> 07:00.850
It's almost time
for the boss to spawn, so I can't.

07:00.850 --> 07:02.480
You're going after the boss again?

07:02.650 --> 07:04.060
Since it's double drops for now.

07:04.060 --> 07:05.360
What? Until when?

07:07.400 --> 07:09.950
<i>They're so into it,
I can't a word in edgewise.</i>

07:10.320 --> 07:12.110
<i>I guess I'll have to PM him.</i>

07:14.780 --> 07:16.370
<i>Hey, he noticed?</i>

07:17.750 --> 07:19.500
<i>That was quick.</i>

07:19.500 --> 07:20.750
<i>Can't he be a little more...</i>

07:22.500 --> 07:26.460
Come talk with us, Yamada,
and help me cheer up Akane!

07:26.670 --> 07:28.050
- I'd rather not.
- That's mean!

07:28.050 --> 07:31.130
Anyway, what I'd like to discuss
is the fact that the guild's storage...

07:31.760 --> 07:34.140
is always stuffed to the brim
and unusable.

07:34.140 --> 07:37.390
What? Hey, you're right!
It's bursting with items!

07:37.930 --> 07:40.140
I haven't been checking it at all!

07:40.390 --> 07:42.060
I always clean it out,

07:42.060 --> 07:43.900
but the next thing I know,
it's full again.

07:43.900 --> 07:45.480
How strange is that?

07:45.860 --> 07:49.690
<i>If it's not at Yamada's,
does that mean it's at the izakaya?</i>

07:49.860 --> 07:53.360
I wonder if someone's
putting items in there out of goodwill?

07:53.740 --> 07:54.870
Oh! That would be me—

07:54.870 --> 07:57.280
What? This trash, out of goodwill?

07:58.620 --> 08:00.450
"Trash" is too harsh!

08:00.450 --> 08:04.000
A guild member must have added
those items to help out the beginners.

08:04.000 --> 08:06.090
Even a newbie
who just started three minutes ago

08:06.090 --> 08:08.210
would have better gear than that.

08:08.210 --> 08:09.210
Now, now!

08:09.920 --> 08:13.130
What if it's a guild member
who happens to be online?

08:13.130 --> 08:15.220
He or she would be crushed
to see this chat!

08:17.890 --> 08:19.100
- It's me.
- Oh!

08:19.180 --> 08:23.140
Akane > I thought the old armor and gear
might come in handy for the beginners...

08:23.140 --> 08:25.190
Akane > I'm sorry...
They're in the way, aren't they?

08:25.190 --> 08:27.980
Rurihime > No, no, they're so not!!!!!!1
You really are a kind soul, Akane!!11

08:27.980 --> 08:30.230
- They're in the way.
- Yamada!

08:31.280 --> 08:33.950
Well, I'm the one who has
to clean up that trash all the time.

08:33.950 --> 08:35.660
Stop calling it trash!

08:35.660 --> 08:38.950
Akane was only trying to help, all right?

08:39.450 --> 08:41.580
Try to be more selective.

08:42.120 --> 08:43.750
Because there's only so much storage.

08:43.750 --> 08:44.870
Yamada!

08:45.330 --> 08:49.630
Seriously! You could have been
a little nicer about it, you bad boy!

08:49.630 --> 08:50.840
Bad! Bad!

08:53.470 --> 08:54.090
Rurihime > Oh...

08:54.090 --> 09:00.470
Rurihime > Really, now! Yamada, you dummy!
Akane's not used to gaming yet,
so try to be nicer to her!!

09:07.060 --> 09:07.980
Ouch.

09:09.270 --> 09:10.480
Did I step on something?

09:23.040 --> 09:24.370
No way.

09:25.750 --> 09:27.080
<i>I hate you, Yamada!</i>

09:41.060 --> 09:42.010
Akane.

09:43.930 --> 09:44.850
I'm sorry.

09:45.980 --> 09:47.600
I wasn't thinking.

09:49.860 --> 09:51.570
I've finally come to my senses.

09:52.980 --> 09:54.070
Takuma!

09:56.530 --> 09:57.360
Here.

09:58.410 --> 10:01.370
I want you to have this peace offering.

10:01.870 --> 10:02.740
Oh.

10:03.620 --> 10:05.250
That makes me so happy, Takuma!

10:06.290 --> 10:07.250
Takuma.

10:09.120 --> 10:10.170
Takuma.

10:10.670 --> 10:11.630
Takuma.

10:14.300 --> 10:15.380
Takuma!

10:24.810 --> 10:25.640
What a nightmare.

10:27.100 --> 10:29.060
More like a prophetic dream, I'd say!

10:31.110 --> 10:33.480
Momo, are you sure
you're not enjoying this?

10:33.480 --> 10:34.530
Oh, not really.

10:34.530 --> 10:37.240
Since your Takuma stories
are getting kind of old.

10:37.860 --> 10:40.070
And that wasn't even a genuine laugh.

10:43.080 --> 10:47.040
Anyway, I'd love to hear
about the hot gamer nerd!

10:47.040 --> 10:50.330
Did you really spend all night with him,
and are you sure nothing happened?

10:50.920 --> 10:52.420
You're going there again?

10:52.420 --> 10:53.960
I told you, nothing happened.

10:53.960 --> 10:56.210
Yamada just helped me out, that's all.

10:56.210 --> 10:57.170
What?

10:58.340 --> 11:02.340
That reminds me, what am I going
to do about Takuma's necklace?

11:02.340 --> 11:05.640
I think I dropped it
at Yamada's place, but...

11:05.640 --> 11:09.480
Huh? What do you want with a gift
from the guy who jilted you?

11:10.060 --> 11:11.230
You're still not over him.

11:12.650 --> 11:15.020
Well, I guess that's who you are.

11:15.020 --> 11:17.610
Always scheduling things around him.

11:18.110 --> 11:21.410
You started playing online games,
which you had zero interest in, for him.

11:22.780 --> 11:25.200
Come to think of it,
when you first started going out,

11:25.200 --> 11:26.990
didn't you make him
homemade box lunches?

11:27.330 --> 11:29.250
I think overall, you're too much.

11:30.460 --> 11:34.380
I won't talk about Takuma anymore,
so please just stop.

11:34.380 --> 11:35.670
As long as you see the light.

11:38.130 --> 11:39.550
<i>6:00, huh?</i>

11:40.050 --> 11:42.640
<i>I'm going to go home
and do the laundry, and then...</i>

11:43.970 --> 11:46.260
<i>I wonder what's on TV tonight?</i>

11:47.260 --> 11:48.640
<i>No plans tonight.</i>

11:49.730 --> 11:52.140
<i>It wouldn't be any fun
playing that game alone.</i>

11:52.690 --> 11:53.850
<i>They're in the way.</i>

11:55.860 --> 11:58.570
<i>I haven't logged in since that day.</i>

11:59.240 --> 12:02.610
<i>Is that snarky afro
having a good time nerding out?</i>

12:03.110 --> 12:04.660
I'm sorry, Akito.

12:07.080 --> 12:09.910
Sorry to stop you
and waste your time like this.

12:11.210 --> 12:13.960
Um... uh...

12:15.170 --> 12:16.130
You see...

12:16.710 --> 12:18.460
<i>A high school girl...</i>

12:18.460 --> 12:20.300
<i>confessing her love, I guess?</i>

12:20.670 --> 12:22.300
<i>Oh, to be young again!</i>

12:22.800 --> 12:25.050
<i>You are one popular guy, mister!</i>

12:26.640 --> 12:31.060
<i>I confessed to an upperclassman, too,
when I was in high school.</i>

12:31.480 --> 12:33.480
<i>- I'm in love with you!
- I have a girlfriend.</i>

12:33.850 --> 12:37.310
<i>That good-looking Saito,
I wonder how he is?</i>

12:37.310 --> 12:39.940
Um... listen.

12:39.940 --> 12:40.860
Are we done here?

12:42.700 --> 12:46.120
It's been about seven minutes
since you stopped me.

12:47.280 --> 12:50.540
Can we take this up again another day
after you've organized your thoughts?

12:50.540 --> 12:51.660
Oh.

12:51.660 --> 12:54.670
Sorry, but it's almost time
for the boss to spawn.

12:56.830 --> 12:58.000
Excuse me.

12:59.170 --> 13:00.420
Come back here!

13:06.390 --> 13:09.100
Oh, of course you've forgotten, right?

13:09.100 --> 13:11.930
I'm Akane, the one you helped out
at that online game event!

13:11.930 --> 13:15.350
Oh, the lady who got hammered
and puked at my place.

13:15.480 --> 13:18.020
I'm really sorry about that.

13:18.020 --> 13:19.440
No, forget that!

13:19.440 --> 13:21.230
That was pretty harsh of Yamada, huh?

13:21.230 --> 13:23.360
Anyone could see
that that was a confession!

13:24.860 --> 13:26.780
You should have heard her out.

13:28.280 --> 13:30.830
I was being confessed to?

13:34.750 --> 13:38.960
Maybe instead of gaming, you should learn
about the subtleties of human nature?

13:38.960 --> 13:40.210
People say that all the time.

13:42.880 --> 13:44.920
So you're in high school, huh, Yamada?

13:44.920 --> 13:45.760
Yes.

13:46.470 --> 13:50.140
Come to think of it, you were drinking
soda the whole time at that izakaya.

13:50.140 --> 13:51.310
Yes.

13:51.310 --> 13:52.560
What grade are you in?

13:52.560 --> 13:53.520
I'm a third year.

13:53.970 --> 13:56.980
<i>Hold up, that's a Tosei Academy uniform.</i>

13:56.980 --> 13:58.770
<i>So you're smart, Yamada?</i>

13:59.400 --> 14:01.320
<i>That school is so tough to get into.</i>

14:06.030 --> 14:06.860
Actually...

14:07.360 --> 14:09.950
I wanted to see you again.

14:18.080 --> 14:21.840
Sorry. I found it later, but...

14:21.840 --> 14:23.090
I stepped on it.

14:24.130 --> 14:26.880
<i>The heart is in two pieces.</i>

14:33.060 --> 14:34.810
Thanks for going to all this trouble!

14:35.310 --> 14:37.390
So you've been carrying it around
all this time?

14:37.390 --> 14:39.940
Well, I heard that we lived
near the same station,

14:39.940 --> 14:41.770
so I figured I'd run into you somewhere.

14:42.820 --> 14:44.780
I guess I should have logged in!

14:44.780 --> 14:46.190
That must have been a hassle!

14:46.190 --> 14:47.030
No.

14:50.030 --> 14:51.240
Thanks!

14:51.240 --> 14:54.330
I was planning to toss it anyway,
so don't worry about it!

14:54.330 --> 14:55.740
All right, I'll be going now.

15:05.670 --> 15:06.510
Um...

15:16.350 --> 15:18.350
Please use this.

15:18.930 --> 15:20.690
You don't have to return it.

15:26.070 --> 15:27.940
Well, then, excuse me.

15:36.660 --> 15:38.790
<i>The rain that started yesterday
in the Kanto area</i>

15:38.790 --> 15:41.120
<i>will be moving northward,
so it will be sunny today.</i>

15:41.120 --> 15:42.790
<i>Tonight's going to have a full moon.</i>

15:43.920 --> 15:45.380
<i>Please use this.</i>

15:49.050 --> 15:52.640
<i>I was planning to toss it anyway,
so don't worry about it!</i>

16:03.650 --> 16:04.980
Yes?

16:09.530 --> 16:11.780
Hello! It's Tagawa Express!

16:12.740 --> 16:14.910
You have a delivery from Mrs. Kinoshita!

16:15.620 --> 16:17.450
We'll just bring it all inside, all right?

16:17.830 --> 16:19.450
Thank you for your business!

16:27.590 --> 16:29.840
<i>About your room here, Akane,</i>

16:29.840 --> 16:32.550
<i>since I'd like to turn it
into my training room,</i>

16:32.550 --> 16:36.050
<i>please take back
all your belongings, okay?</i>

16:36.050 --> 16:36.970
<i>Thank you!</i>

16:38.970 --> 16:40.390
So...

16:40.390 --> 16:42.020
what do you need me for?

16:43.020 --> 16:47.060
Help me, Momo! It's so cluttered,
I have nowhere to stand!

16:47.940 --> 16:51.400
My mom sent back my stuff out of the blue,
but can you believe how much there is?

16:51.400 --> 16:53.030
What am I supposed to do?

16:54.530 --> 16:56.780
What a drag. Toss it all.

16:58.410 --> 17:00.120
Start with that humongous bear!

17:00.120 --> 17:02.910
Wait! I have fond memories of that bear!
Memories of my grandma!

17:02.910 --> 17:04.620
- Memories of my grandma!
- Shut up!

17:05.370 --> 17:07.080
- Grandma!
- All right, next!

17:07.880 --> 17:08.710
Next!

17:09.170 --> 17:10.000
Next!

17:17.510 --> 17:18.760
Akane!

17:19.720 --> 17:21.930
These two things are just clutter.

17:23.350 --> 17:24.890
Where do you want to put them?

17:25.140 --> 17:27.900
The umbrella's new,
so you'll still be using it, right?

17:27.900 --> 17:30.770
This necklace is broken,
so can I throw it away?

17:32.990 --> 17:35.280
<i>Try to be more selective.</i>

17:36.200 --> 17:38.240
<i>Because there's only so much storage.</i>

17:41.240 --> 17:42.080
Huh?

17:46.080 --> 17:47.710
Be selective.

17:47.710 --> 17:48.540
Huh?

17:51.750 --> 17:56.720
<i>I can't hold onto every single thing
that's precious to me.</i>

18:03.430 --> 18:07.230
So you ended up not tossing that one, huh?

18:07.230 --> 18:08.060
Yeah.

18:09.610 --> 18:10.480
<i>But...</i>

18:11.270 --> 18:12.780
<i>I'm throwing out everything else.</i>

18:14.150 --> 18:17.240
<i>Because I don't need them anymore.</i>

18:26.580 --> 18:30.040
All right! How about we hit
the barbecue place and live it up?

18:30.040 --> 18:31.750
On you, of course, Akane!

18:31.750 --> 18:35.300
Money's tight,
so I'll have to ask you to go easy.

18:56.570 --> 18:57.400
Yes?

18:57.950 --> 19:01.820
Yamara! I'm here to return your umbrella!

19:02.280 --> 19:05.540
Oh, wow! He really is hot!

19:06.580 --> 19:08.040
I'm Momo!

19:08.750 --> 19:11.750
Nice to meet you, Yamara!

19:14.040 --> 19:15.340
Here!

19:17.300 --> 19:20.130
Huh? Something bothering you?

19:20.130 --> 19:23.050
No, it's just... I don't know what to say.

19:23.430 --> 19:28.430
Yamada, I'm so sorry that Akane's
always making trouble for you.

19:28.430 --> 19:32.440
But if you'd like,
you can take this opportunity...

19:32.440 --> 19:35.480
to go out with me with marriage in mind!

19:37.650 --> 19:39.950
I'm seriously
this close to calling the cops.

19:40.650 --> 19:42.870
Didn't I say
there was no need to return it?

19:43.370 --> 19:44.990
I mean, this is actually annoying.

19:45.490 --> 19:46.580
Um...

19:48.620 --> 19:51.080
The umbrella. Right, I hear you.

19:51.580 --> 19:52.710
But aside from that...

19:54.380 --> 19:55.630
I came to thank you!

19:57.880 --> 19:59.670
The day of that event...

19:59.670 --> 20:01.630
I'm so glad you were there, Yamada.

20:03.470 --> 20:07.600
If I'd been alone,
it would have been really rough for me.

20:09.430 --> 20:10.560
I'm really...

20:11.480 --> 20:12.650
<i>Are you all right?</i>

20:13.480 --> 20:14.690
...thankful to you!

20:18.530 --> 20:19.490
Right.

20:24.620 --> 20:27.910
Okay! We'll be leaving
before you call the cops on us!

20:27.910 --> 20:28.950
I'd appreciate that.

20:30.290 --> 20:32.920
Come on, Momo! We're going home!

20:34.920 --> 20:37.420
Walk like a big girl, okay?

20:47.260 --> 20:50.100
Momo! Watch your step now!

20:54.100 --> 20:55.270
By the way...

20:59.320 --> 21:00.150
Ruri—

21:00.940 --> 21:03.860
The guild master was worried about you...

21:05.110 --> 21:08.370
saying that you
haven't logged in since that day.

21:12.790 --> 21:13.620
So...

21:14.750 --> 21:18.090
well, if you're ever free sometime...

21:21.710 --> 21:22.840
I'll do it!

21:23.260 --> 21:24.340
I'll do it right away!

21:24.340 --> 21:25.970
I'll log in as soon as I get home!

21:25.970 --> 21:27.140
What about you, Yamada?

21:27.140 --> 21:28.680
No, I'm going to bed.

21:28.680 --> 21:29.810
You're not going to play?

